output files

Sample 1-D output files are NOT distributed with ExoRT releases, to keep the
repository small and uncluttered.

To generate an output, run one of the input profiles from ../input_files
through the 1-D model:

  cd ../../run
  cp ../iofiles/input_files/RTprofile_in_TS300K.nc RTprofile_in.nc
  ./n68equiv.exe
  # result is written to RTprofile_out.nc

See the top-level README.md for full run instructions.
